      147.09,
      333.13,
      440.52,
      344.2
    ],
    "text": "Notification Made by the Governor of the North Western Province",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      357.13,
      539.94,
      404.2
    ],
    "text": "I, Amara Piyaseeli Rathnayaka being the Governor of the North Western Province in terms of power vested in me underSub-section 8(a) of Section 154(b) of Amendment Act, No. Thirteen of the Constitution of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka, do hereby proclaim that the First Session of the Sixth Provincial Council in the North WesternProvince is terminated with effect from Mid Night on 8th December 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      417.13,
      539.96,
      452.2
    ],
    "text": "It is hereby further proclaimed that the Second Session of the Sixth Provincial Council in the North WesternProvince in summoned to be held at the \u201cSasri\u201d hall in the Provincial Council Office Complex, Kurunegala at 10.30 am on16th January 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      465.13,
      308.89,
      476.2
    ],
    "text": "Proclaimed at Kurunegala on this 8th December 2017.",
